{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is seen, approach, take it and check properties. Then move to next location. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectImportant    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    />\"",
